  "description": "UML 2.5.1 Foundation subset, auto-generated from schemas/uml-foundation.ts via @fdpm/zod-bridge. Fourteen metaclasses as primitives with field-level Zod validators, plus twelve author-declared relation types (ownership, typing, generalisation, realisation, dependency, association ends, annotation, constraint) merged by finalizeProfile.",
